{
  "name": "tier3-cryptify-link-only",
  "description": "Payload past PG_MAX_ATTACHMENT_SIZE: no local attachment at all, so the recipient has only the Cryptify link. A reader that keys on the attachment alone finds nothing here, which is the asymmetry that broke the website uuid path (#39).",
